<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money market shortage below 9.5 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.African money market shortage below 9.5 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank said the South African money market shortage held below 9.50 billion rand on Friday and Saturday.</p>
<p>The central bank quoted the shortage at 9.475 billion on Saturday from 9.499 billion on Friday and compared to Thursday's 9.788 billion rand.</p>
<p>Monday was a public holiday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
